Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations on your conditional admission to Arizona State University! You can be fully admitted to ASU by completing ASU-ESL (also known as AECP) Advanced Level 2 or submitting a TOEFL score. Learn more at http://esl.asu.edu/.

Feel free to contact me if you have any additional questions.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
